  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "In the figure shown, a circuit contains two identical resistors with resistance <math><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#937;</mi></math> and an inductance with <math><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>m</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>.</mo></math> An ideal battery of <math><mn>15</mn><mi>V</mi></math> is connected in the circuit. What will be the current through the battery long after the switch is closed?<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/civwrfuzbhvhdnpjxmjyowjujddqconbickfdhhpxrioadaznl.png\" />",
    "image": null
  },
